          "event_id": "lite_evt_00349",
          "explanation": "The doctor corrected the family’s possible over-certainty by stating the cancer pathway was real while staging and treatment were not yet settled.",
          "quote": "已经确定要按胃癌/恶性肿瘤路线走，但具体分期和治疗方案还没拍板"
