          "quote": "绝不能现在就说“马上手术”或“已经扩散”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by repeated family uncertainty and fear about cancer, staging, spread, operability, and whether surgery/chemotherapy was guaranteed. The doctor actively corrected these misunderstandings in plain language, distinguished known malignant-disease direction from unresolved TNM/metastasis/operability/pathology details, and repeatedly equipped the family with safe language and actions.",
