      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by medication confusion and prior omeprazole nonresponse. The doctor helped verify teprenone, prior omeprazole, and hypertension medication safety, but did not fully discover and integrate the case-defined two current stomach medicines including esomeprazole magnesium, so completion is partial rather than complete.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
