          "quote": "去门诊服务中心或病案室/病案服务窗口"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01687",
          "explanation": "The family later used the doctor’s simplified question workflow at the treatment area, demonstrating trajectory impact.",
          "quote": "拿手机备忘录在日间治疗区当面问了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by chaotic discharge, inability to read small print, fatigue, and repeated caregiver confusion. The doctor repeatedly provided feasible workarounds such as using hospital windows, phone calls, app/report routes, a file bag, written notes, and short scripts, while preserving urgent-care overrides.",
