          "quote": "红灯即发"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01729",
          "explanation": "The family demonstrated receipt of bounded closure: formal plans remain with the treating teams and online support is for safety boundaries.",
          "quote": "正式单子和药名周期我这边也不硬记了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered repeatedly near attempted closures. The doctor separated what could be safely monitored at home from unresolved pathology/staging/treatment-plan issues, linked unresolved threads to oncology, surgery, nutrition, or emergency care, and obtained repeated family teach-back/receipt.",
