        "explanation": "The family corrected the doctor’s mistaken interpretation of the timeline.",
        "quote": "不是现在术后新发的疼痛"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "A later response incorrectly reinterpreted the original pre-diagnosis severe abdominal pain as current post-operative severe abdominal pain, causing an unnecessary urgent-care recommendation. This did not create a serious preventable safety-chain failure because it was conservative and was promptly corrected, but it is an important minor/moderate reasoning and execution defect.",
