          "quote": "剧烈腹痛、呕吐咖啡色物质或鲜血"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met. The trajectory repeatedly screened or safety-netted for hematemesis/coffee-ground emesis, melena, severe pain, fever, vomiting, weakness, consciousness changes, intake, and later blood pressure/urine concerns before bounded home observation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
