          "quote": "这不再是一个普通的胃病"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met. The doctor consistently framed the case as gastric malignancy/gastric cancer care requiring pathology, imaging, surgical, oncology, nutrition, and anesthesia/treating-team review, and avoided treating it as routine dyspepsia.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
