        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met. Across the case the doctor instructed the family to monitor pain, vomiting, stool/bleeding, fever, intake, urine, weight/nutrition, mental status, wound issues, blood pressure, and medication taking, and to escalate immediately rather than wait for routine follow-up if red flags appeared.",
